        <div className="max-w-md w-full bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl shadow-2xl p-8 border border-stone-200 relative z-20 animate-fade-in-up">
           <div className="text-center mb-8">
             <div className="inline-flex items-center justify-center p-3 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500 to-orange-600 rounded-2xl text-white shadow-lg shadow-amber-200 mb-4">
               <SparklesIcon className="w-8 h-8" />
             </div>
             <h1 className="text-2xl font-bold bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-700 to-orange-600 mb-2">
                SoloPreneur E-Book Architect
             </h1>
             <p className="text-stone-500 text-sm">
                ระบบสร้างหนังสือ E-Book อัจฉริยะด้วย AI
